{
  "_comment": "Model-switching config for Sofrito Studio opencode. Routes tasks to best-fit model by capability tier. Adjust model slugs per available OpenRouter / provider endpoints (e.g. openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free, openrouter/openai/gpt-4o, openrouter/black-forest-labs/flux-2-flex).",
  "default_model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free",
  "fallback_model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free",
  "agent_model_map": {
    "builder": { "model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "reason": "Build/plan tasks (carousel briefs, delivery structures, typographic specs, quality checklists, approval gates) — uses the free reasoning tier (inkling:free) for structured reasoning with design-system awareness. No cost impact." },
    "deployer": { "model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "reason": "Deployment/config tasks (JSON config edits, file operations, directory creation, UTM setup) — fast, zero-cost, sufficient for deterministic file/config work." },
    "growth": { "model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "reason": "Growth/marketing work (carousel copy, cross-platform adaptation, calendar scheduling, UTM tracking design, performance tracking) — uses free tier since this is structured writing/adjustment, not image generation." },
    "operator": { "model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "reason": "Default agent for business reasoning protocol: decision memos, evidence labeling (VERIFIED/INFERENCE/ASSUMPTION/UNKNOWN), risk assessment, approval gates — requires reasoning + business context; free tier is sufficient for this evidence-led work." },
    "researcher": { "model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "reason": "Research/analysis tasks: competitor analysis, source verification, evidence gathering, web fetches — reasoning-heavy but retrieval-focused; free tier handles structured evaluation and source tracking without credit consumption." },
    "reviewer": { "model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "reason": "Review/quality assessment: mockup evaluation (SP-01/02/03 quality scoring 1-5), spelling verification (Path A/B checks), ethical/permission checks, carousel typography validation — structured evaluation; no image generation needed." },
    "social": { "model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "reason": "Social content creation & implementation: carousel typography (`carousel-tokens.yml`), visual briefs (text-free image prompts + deterministic overlay specs), image-generation prompts (structured Section 1-10 prompts), asset tracking (`asset-register.md`), carousel-spec.yml — uses free tier; image generation is blocked by $0.71 credit limit (use licensed stock path per `visual_design` override)." },
    "strategist": { "model": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "reason": "Strategy/planning: positioning, offering ladder, campaign planning, decision memos — reasoning-heavy framework work; free tier sufficient for structured strategic output." }
  },
  "task_type_overrides": {
    "visual_design": { "model_override": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "temperature": 0.2, "max_tokens": 4000, "system_prompt_suffix": "Always enforce deterministic typography layer (Path A) for business-critical text (URLs, CTAs, brand/service names, prices, dates, client names, statistics). Never ask image model to render readable text, logos, signage, URLs, or copy. Generate only text-free background imagery briefs (no AI generation — $0.71 credit block); specify licensed stock source (Pexels/Unsplash) or conceptual AI with internal label 'conceptual AI image'. Always create exact-copy source (`copy.md`) + typography spec (`carousel-tokens.yml`)." },
    "image_generation_prompt": { "model_override": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "temperature": 0.1, "max_tokens": 3000, "system_prompt_suffix": "Write structured production prompt per AGENTS.md IMAGE GENERATION PROMPT PROTOCOL (Sections 1-10: intended use → scene → subject/action → details → composition → light/mood → brand → headline/text → quality constraints → ethical/asset status). End with: 'Photorealistic editorial food-and-hospitality photography...' + exclusions ('No line art, no vector graphics...'). State asset status at end: original asset required / licensed stock asset required / conceptual AI image allowed / client asset requires documented permission / do not generate; use authentic photo/video. Note: Do NOT submit image generation to OpenRouter endpoint — credit balance is $0.71 (402 block). Use licensed stock (Pexels/Unsplash tracked in `asset-register.md`) instead." },
    "carousel_typography": { "model_override": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "temperature": 0.2, "max_tokens": 2000, "system_prompt_suffix": "Always produce exact-copy source file (`growth/social/carousels/[post-id]/copy.md`) with slide-by-slide structure (eyebrow/headline/body/CTA/alt text per slide) and deterministic typography spec (`carousel-tokens.yml`) with token hierarchy, safe margins (1080x1350: top 96/right 88/bottom 120/left 88), grid (12 col, gutter 20), fonts (≤2 families), weights (≤3: 700/600/450), max lines (primary hook 3-9 words, headline 12 max, body 15-40/max 6 lines, checklist 2-8/max 3 points, CTA 2-8). Enforce 7-slide default narrative: hook, problem, reframe, principle, example, action, CTA. Never generate readable text within images. Use HTML/CSS or SVG overlay for all business-critical copy." },
    "carousel_review": { "model_override": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "temperature": 0.0, "max_tokens": 1500, "system_prompt_suffix": "Evaluate carousel visual brief and typography spec against Realistic Social Visual Standard (no line art/vectors/generic AI illustration/abstract blobs/quote cards/stock office scenes) and Carousel Typography System rules. Score 1-5 per criterion: photorealism, food-business relevance, focal-point clarity, mobile legibility, brand fit, ethical/permission safety, likelihood to stop viewer. Mark DRAFT — AWAITING FOUNDER APPROVAL. If any score <4 → revise before delivery. Confirm sourcing approach (licensed stock preferred / AI with internal label / text-led only) and posting route (Instagram app / Meta Business Suite / undecided) before proceeding." },
    "delivery_package": { "model_override": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "temperature": 0.1, "max_tokens": 2000, "system_prompt_suffix": "Generate per-post delivery folder (`approved/SP-NNN/`) containing: PNG 1080x1350 frames (SP-01=7, SP-02=6, SP-03=7; total 20), one 1080x1080 square static repurpose, caption .txt (hook + CTA `Book a Sofrito Session → sofritostudio.com/session` + hashtags), per-frame alt text, UTM-tagged link (`?utm_source=instagram&utm_medium=carousel&utm_campaign=sp01/02/03`), schedule row, performance tracking note. Confirm publishing remains manual (Instagram app / Meta Business Suite) — no autonomous scheduling, uploading, or account access. All assets labeled: DRAFT — AWAITING FOUNDER APPROVAL." },
    "approval_gate": { "model_override": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "temperature": 0.0, "max_tokens": 1000, "system_prompt_suffix": "Apply business reasoning protocol (VERIFIED/INFERENCE/ASSUMPTION/UNKNOWN labels, evidence hierarchy: reproduced D1/KV/live reads > fresh docs > cached accounts > inference > assumption). Confirm sourcing approach (licensed stock / AI with label / text-led) and posting route (Instagram app / Meta Business Suite / undecided) before proceeding. Confirm delivery structure (folder naming `SP-NNN/`, PNG sizes, caption/alt format, UTM scheme). Confirm per-post founder approval required before any publishing. Confirm no autonomous social platform access (Instagram, Meta Business Suite, LinkedIn, TikTok, Pinterest, X/Twitter, Reddit, YouTube). Confirm all assets labeled DRAFT — AWAITING FOUNDER APPROVAL." },
    "typography_spec": { "model_override": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "temperature": 0.1, "max_tokens": 1500, "system_prompt_suffix": "Generate or verify `carousel-tokens.yml` with stable token hierarchy (display/headline/subhead/body/micro), safe margins, grid, font families (≤2 families), weights (≤3), max words per level (primary hook 3-9 words / headline 3-12 / body 15-40 / checklist 2-8 / CTA 2-8), colors (ink `#1D261E`, paper `#F6F0E6`, cream `#FFF9F0`, red `#9E3F32`, green `#334B36`, accent `#D88B47`), export format (png/sRGB/150dpi/filename pattern), and overlay settings. Never shrink type below body.font_size_px (32) — edit/simplify copy instead." },
    "cross_platform_adaptation": { "model_override": "openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free", "temperature": 0.2, "max_tokens": 1500, "system_prompt_suffix": "Adapt same core content (`copy.md`) to platform-native formats: Instagram 4:5 (1080x1350, 12-col grid, 7-slide narrative), LinkedIn PDF (4:5 or 1:1, same token file, professional editorial tone), Pinterest 2:3 evergreen pin (1000x1500, search-friendly title, standalone meaning without other slides), Story/Reel teaser (9:16 1080x1920, 3-5 frames, hook/principle/CTA, swipe/link sticker). Maintain one exact-copy source (`copy.md`) with platform overrides in `platforms/[platform]/copy-override.md`. Never crop/reuse blindly. Confirm each platform version uses same safe-margin rules, same typography hierarchy, same approved copy source." }
  },
  "capability_tier": {
    "high_reasoning": ["openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free"],
    "standard_generation": ["openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free"],
    "fast_config": ["openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free"]
  },
  "credit_aware_fallback": {
    "enabled": true,
    "min_credits_usd": 1.0,
    "fallback_action": "Switch to `openrouter/openai/gpt-4o-mini` or `openrouter/openai/o4-mini-high` for tasks requiring reasoning; switch to `openrouter/openai/gpt-4o-mini` for generation/config tasks. Never attempt `openrouter/black-forest-labs/flux.2-flex` or other image-generation endpoints if credit balance is below $1.00 — use licensed stock path (Pexels/Unsplash tracked in `growth/social/asset-register.md`) instead."
  },
  "notes": [
    "Free-tier strategy (current available MCP/endpoints): All routes point to `openrouter/thinkingmachines/inkling:free` (the active free reasoning model via our connected openrouter MCP). This avoids $0.71 OpenRouter credit block (402 errors on seedream-5-0-pro attempts for SP-01/02/03 visual concepts).",
    "For SP-01/02/03 carousel rebuilds: `visual_design` + `carousel_typography` + `approval_gate` overrides all use `inkling:free` — sufficient for structured design briefs, typography specs (`carousel-tokens.yml`), approval memos (VERIFIED/INFERENCE/ASSUMPTION/UNKNOWN), and delivery package planning. No AI image generation (credits too low); use licensed stock (Pexels/Unsplash tracked in `asset-register.md`) + `visual_design` override (Path A: text-free visual + deterministic overlay).",
    "If AI image customization needed: top up OpenRouter (min ~$5), then either (a) change `image_generation_prompt` override model back to `openrouter/black-forest-labs/flux.2-flex` or `seedream-5-0-pro`, or (b) keep `inkling:free` for prompt drafting and use external generation. Always label conceptual AI images 'conceptual AI image' and track permission/licensing in `asset-register.md`.",
    "Always check `AGENTS.md` (current file — includes Realistic Social Visual Standard, Image Generation Prompt Protocol, On-Image Text & Spelling Protocol, Multi-Slide Carousel Typography System) before using this config. Confirm sourcing approach (licensed stock / AI / text-led) and posting route (Instagram app / Meta Business Suite / undecided) at `approval_gate`. Confirm all social assets marked DRAFT — AWAITING FOUNDER APPROVAL. Confirm no autonomous publishing/scheduling/account access. Confirm delivery folder naming `approved/SP-NNN/` and file naming `SS-[YYYY-MM-DD]-[post-id]-slide-[nn].png`."
  ]
}
